{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1798.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"929300ecdc45d5a6ca1aa6eee4dbd7d93e5c9f24fa4b42441eda2b5ec10e2892","ja":"未来はお急ぎ","zh":"未来匆匆忙忙","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1798.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"8d031a1c58219f57675d56a475c1da45f5ab9d9cd018a92eaac7018d47408607","ja":"とある日。未来、杏奈、可奈、紬の4人は\n人気ゲームのイベントに出演して……","zh":"某一天。未来、杏奈、可奈、紬等4人参加了热门游戏的活动……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1798.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"e695d9034bf696d850a48fd6c3e3969cea69cc114a637da26bdeaf2ce6c568ca","ja":"イエーイ！　大好きなゲームができて、\n杏奈、最高にハッピーだったよ～！！","zh":"耶——！能玩最喜欢的游戏，杏奈真的超级开心哦～！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1798.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"a040a2658cf7c3edf5428aec85bced2f0820f985286871405582a1fe561aa2c6","ja":"杏奈ちゃん、お仕事終わっても、\nオンモードのままだね。大活躍だったからかな？","zh":"杏奈，工作结束了也还是保持着工作模式呢。是因为今天大显身手了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1798.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"810ff4c1c2e66f7d3d709cdf32bb880dbcd00210dbb9efb90cdaa977c22d8a9a","ja":"敵を投げ投げ～♪　テンションアゲアゲ～♪","zh":"把敌人扔来扔去～♪　情绪嗨起来～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1798.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"8fe36b6fad12ff9970fdcd2897edaca107d5cff5c138fa5a8f172a6ee966c10e","ja":"みんな、お疲れさま！\nお先に失礼しま～す！","zh":"大家辛苦了！\n我先走一步啦～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1798.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"63d0d6d8c5c4953b3a242ba5dbd326dc4187fe69bf6d3a2fe25865f339e5521c","ja":"春日さん、もう帰られるのですか？\nまた明日……あっ、もう行ってしまいました。","zh":"春日小姐，您已经要回去了吗？\n明天见……啊，已经走掉了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1798.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"a103e704301c7a37876a1e3cad3fd450a4371ce24b0f97ed95fd998515132151","ja":"未来ちゃん、なんだか最近忙しそうですね。\n今日の待ち時間のときも、ソワソワしちゃってたし。","zh":"未来，感觉你最近好像很忙呢。\n今天等待的时候，你也一直坐立不安的。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1798.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"70b9b6f79e532aa4dc4f6b6748b45002cff16a75176b1798e0ff4114151e3db5","ja":"そうですね……。今日はつつがなく終わりましたが、\nこのままだと、お仕事にも影響がでるかもしれません。","zh":"是啊……今天虽然顺利结束了，但这样下去，可能会影响到工作。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1798.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"7000ee25eb06f93fa3606a20719dd66cc4becce7c539c16df2eba6c03adf5d34","ja":"でも未来、なんだかすごくイキイキしてたよ？\nゲームしてる時の杏奈みたいに！","zh":"不过未来，你刚才总觉得特别有活力呢？\n就像玩游戏时的杏奈一样！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1798.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"3d7e32f095b38a0f965663e5d5dfa60270e837cd84ffcc4ae5c0e410c43d18ed","ja":"あ、確かに。なんだか、楽しそうだよね。","zh":"啊，确实。感觉好像很开心呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1798.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"96ca80cfba45033fe26fcb0f52e3cdac2b80734aaddcc3b60aab580c0befa0ce","ja":"でもそれなら、もっと気になってきたかも。\n私、明日もお仕事一緒なので、聞いてみますねっ！","zh":"不过这样一来，我可能更在意了。\n明天我也要一起工作，我去问问看哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
